ns from 1951 to 2025, 75 years in all. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, September to October came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 155% of normal in April to May and 51% in September to October. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 43% of normal on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
